sequenceDiagram
 autonumber
actor U as Presenter
 participant A as Setup / review controller
 participant L as Local capture / player
 participant S as API / workers
 Note over U,S: 7. Selected-slide practice and comparison | Planned
 U->>A: Select slides from deck D
 A->>A: Require nonempty original indexes, freeze<br/>selection
 A->>L: Create new attempt B + audio target +<br/>selection
 Note over A,L: Earlier attempt A stays unchanged.<br/>Only selected slides may be visited, repeats/backward visits remain.
 U->>L: Record and stop
 L-->>A: Durably saved audio + events
 A-->>U: Confirm valid upload/transcription<br/>disclosure (Figure 4A)
 alt Denied or upload fails
  A-->>U: Local playback, retry upload later, no<br/>server polling
 else Upload succeeds
  A->>S: Upload B + selected_slide_indexes +<br/>optional source_attempt_id
  S->>S: Validate original indexes/events, process<br/>same recording
  Note right of S: Summary, delivery and coaching<br/>use actual visits within selection.<br/>Unvisited selected slides are not scored.
  S-->>A: Independent results/states for B
 end
 U->>A: Compare A and B
 A->>A: Load local/cached attempt records
 opt Known server attempt IDs
  A->>S: Read authorized attempts and saved results
  S-->>A: Deck IDs, slide identities, visits and<br/>available results
  Note over A,S: Read failure keeps cached comparison.<br/>No server request for a local-only attempt.
 end
 A->>A: Match (deck_id, slide_index), retain each<br/>visit and time axis
 alt No common practiced slide
  A-->>U: Explain no shared slide, choose another<br/>attempt
 else Shared slide
  A-->>U: Show A/B transcripts, rates and available<br/>feedback
  Note over U,A: Missing feedback is unavailable, not zero.<br/>Repeated visits remain individually selectable.
  U->>A: Play evidence from A or B
  A->>L: Switch single player source, seek on that<br/>attempt timeline
  L-->>A: Playback position, synchronize its slide<br/>and visit
 end
